WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.150
What happens when a copy of Nintendogs is
placed into SCP-914?

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.340
Wanting to experiment was a calm, low-stakes
game, Jr.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:13.560
Researcher Dart selected five copies of Nintendogs
for the DS for experimentation.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.760
All copies of the game were placed into the
Clockworks on the setting "Fine."

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:23.570
The output produced wasa copy of "NintenSCPs:
Safe" for the Nintendo Switch.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:29.349
All SCPs featured in the game were Safe class,
and some SCPs appeared as shop owners.

